		{"id":"0bde8ccc791af886","type":"text","text":"点动成线，线动成面，面动成体。","x":560,"y":340,"width":340,"height":60},
		{"id":"df4e759738409065","type":"text","text":"\n[[三视图]]","x":1640,"y":348,"width":100,"height":60},
		{"id":"72d1254bb13ffadc","type":"text","text":"图形是由点（point）、线（line）、面（plane）构成的。面与面相交得到线，线与线相交得到点。  ","x":560,"y":200,"width":340,"height":113},
